  "description": "Installation of a GRP plant housing adjoining the existing generator enclosure and HV sub-station\r\rThe GRP housing will be site on a concrete plinth, with cables entering the housing to the rear above ground due to the presence of other services in the area. \r\rThe existing switchgear panel is located within the generator housing. The space in which it is being installed is below current standards. In addition to replace the switchgear in its current location would require the power to be isolated for up to a week, which is unacceptable for the provision of healthcare services on the site.",
